    {
      "block_id": "h3-10",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "`task.py` — Subagent spawn with full AgentLoop",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "code-11",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "python",
      "content": "subagent_loop = AgentLoop(\n    config=call_config,\n    agent_name=agent_profile_name,\n    is_subagent=True,\n    defer_heavy_init=True,\n)",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "detailed",
        "collapsible": true,
        "collapsed_by_default": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "**Problem:** Creates a full `AgentLoop` with conversation loop, middleware, hooks, and all mixins for a bounded mission worker. The subagent should not need: - Full conversation loop (should be single-turn or bounded mission) - Middleware pipeline (should inherit owner policy) - Hooks (subagent is not user-facing) - Fork/compact/switch_agent (bounded lifecycle)",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "**Recommendation:** Replace with `SubagentRuntime` that owns bounded mission execution: assigned worktree, allowed tools/profile binding, budget, artifact contract, validation receipt.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-14",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "No Ralph loop exists",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Ralph (`rig_relay/ralph/`) currently has no AgentLoop construction. It is an observe-only scanner. Any future `RalphRuntime` should NOT be built on AgentLoop — it should use `SubagentRuntime` with `profile_kind=AUTONOMOUS_BACKGROUND` and `trust_tier=OBSERVE`.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    }
